r.classFunctions_apply_of_isConj","kind":"theorem","line":205,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/GroupAlgebraCenter.lean#L205-L211","doc":"A class function takes the same value on conjugate elements. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.GroupAlgebraCenter.mem_classFunctions","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.GroupAlgebraCenter.mem_classFunctions","kind":"theorem","line":202,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/GroupAlgebraCenter.lean#L202-L203","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.GroupAlgebraCenter.classFunctions","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.GroupAlgebraCenter.classFunctions","kind":"def","line":193,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/GroupAlgebraCenter.lean#L193-L198","doc":"The **class functions** `G → k`: those constant on conjugacy classes. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.GroupAlgebraCenter.finrank_center_le_card_conjClasses","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.GroupAlgebraCenter.finrank_center_le_card_conjClasses","kind":"theorem","line":169,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/GroupAlgebraCenter.lean#L169-L178","doc":"**`dim_k Z(k[G]) ≤ #conj classes`.**  Immediate from `center_le_span_classSum`\nand `finrank_range_le_card`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.GroupAlgebraCenter.center_le_span_classSum","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.GroupAlgebraCenter.center_le_span_classSum","kind":"theorem","line":127,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/GroupAlgebraCenter.lean#L127-L159","doc":"**The centre is contained in the span of the class sums.**\n\nA central `z` is constant on classes, so `z = Σ_c z(cᵒᵘᵗ) · classSum c`; the\ncarriers partition `G`, which turns the double sum back into `Σ_g single g (z g) = z`.\n\nOnly this inclusion is proved — the class sums are in fact a *basis*, but the\ncounting argument needs no more than the resulting dimension bound. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.GroupAlgebraCenter.carrier_toFinset_eq_filter","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.GroupAlgebraCenter.carrier_toFinset_eq_filter","kind":"theorem","line":120,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/GroupAlgebraCenter.lean#L120-L124","doc":"Each conjugacy class's carrier is the fibre of `ConjClasses.mk` over it. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.GroupAlgebraCenter.coeff_eq_of_isConj","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.GroupAlgebraCenter.coeff_eq_of_isConj","kind":"theorem","line":109,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/GroupAlgebraCenter.lean#L109-L117","doc":"The coefficients of a central element are constant on conjugacy classes. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.GroupAlgebraCenter.coeff_conj_eq_of_mem_center","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.GroupAlgebraCenter.coeff_conj_eq_of_mem_center","kind":"theorem","line":91,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/GroupAlgebraCenter.lean#L91-L106","doc":"Conjugation-invariance of the coefficients of a central element.\n\n`z` central means `single h 1 * z = z * single h 1` for every `h`; comparing\ncoefficients at `h * g` gives `z g = z (h⁻¹ * g * h)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.GroupAlgebraCenter.classSum","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.GroupAlgebraCenter.classSum","kind":"def","line":86,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/GroupAlgebraCenter.lean#L86-L88","doc":"The **class sum** of a conjugacy class: the sum of its elements in `k[G]`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.GroupAlgebraCenter.card_conjClasses_perm_fin_le","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.GroupAlgebraCenter.card_conjClasses_perm_fin_le","kind":"theorem","line":63,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/GroupAlgebraCenter.lean#L63-L67","doc":"The `Fin n` case, with the cardinality reduced. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.GroupAlgebraCenter.card_conjClasses_le","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.GroupAlgebraCenter.card_conjClasses_le","kind":"theorem","line":53,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/GroupAlgebraCenter.lean#L53-L61","doc":"**Conjugacy classes of a symmetric group inject into partitions.**  Two\npermutations are conjugate exactly when they have the same cycle type, so the\npartition map separates classes.\n\nSurjectivity — every partition is a cycle type — is *true* but not needed for\nthe count, and is not in Mathlib. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.GroupAlgebraCenter.conjPartition_injective","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.GroupAlgebraCenter.conjPartition_injective","kind":"theorem","line":48,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/GroupAlgebraCenter.lean#L48-L51","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.GroupAlgebraCenter.conjPartition","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.GroupAlgebraCenter.conjPartition","kind":"def","line":44,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/GroupAlgebraCenter.lean#L44-L46","doc":"The cycle-type partition, as a map out of conjugacy classes. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.GroupAlgebraCenter.decidableIsConjPerm","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.GroupAlgebraCenter.decidableIsConjPerm","kind":"instance","line":41,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/GroupAlgebraCenter.lean#L41-L42","signatureChunk":0}]}